false,"turn_index":17,"usage":null},{"content":"2GB of extra data has been successfully added to your line for $4.00. You should now have restored high-speed mobile data.\n\nIf your internet does not start working immediately, please try restarting your phone to refresh the connection.\n\nLet me know if you need any further assistance!","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:25:19.542835","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":59,"prompt_tokens":7394}},{"content":"Thanks for adding the data. My internet is still not working as fast as I need it to. Is there anything else I should try? I really need excellent internet speed, not just “good” or “fair.”","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:25:20.596297","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":46,"prompt_tokens":2743}},{"content":"Let’s continue troubleshooting to help you achieve excellent internet speed. I’ll guide you through a few steps to identify and resolve any remaining issues.\n\nFirst, could you please run a speed test on your phone and let me know the result? This will help us determine your current connection quality and the next best steps.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:25:22.368240","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":20,"usage":{"completion_tokens":64,"prompt_tokens":7503}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:25:23.650582","tool_call_id